---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: writing/index.html
title: Writing | Kai Ase Siren
description: Technical writing about platform engineering, cloud systems, developer tooling, and working with agents.
canonical: /writing/
robots: follow, index
---
<div class="portfolio-page writing-page">
  <header class="portfolio-page__hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Writing</p>
    <h1>Notes from building the systems behind the work.</h1>
    <p>
      Platform engineering, cloud boundaries, developer tools, and the
      occasional method for thinking with machines.
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="writing-list" aria-label="Articles">
    <div>
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% if post.data.promoted %}
        <div>
          <a class="homepage-post" href="{{ post.url }}">
            <div>
              <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
              {% if post.data.description %}<p class="homepage-post__lede">{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
              <p class="homepage-post__date"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDay }}">{{ post.date | monthYear }}</time></p>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
